# Frontend design

## Tokens

Use CSS variables in `frontend/src/styles.css`. Rules and contrast: [docs/DESIGN.md](docs/DESIGN.md).

## Forbidden

No gradients, glows, sparkle/emoji icons, or CDN fonts/assets (fonts bundled in build).

## Accessibility

WCAG AA pairs; axe checks in `frontend/e2e/a11y-offline.spec.ts`. Keyboard: focusable nodes, `/` search, `Esc` clear.

## Components

Popover pattern in `components/Popover.tsx`; keep dropdowns inside viewport (see `e2e/projects.spec.ts`).
